CustomField.formula:
IF(

    X3_Months_Promo_calc2__c=2,
    "Yes",
    "No"
)

/* Looks at the DLRS 3 Months Promo Calc field which is rolling up the 3 Months Free field on any Opportunity Product of "Tier". If a "Tier" Product is found with a 3 Months Free input, then the Opportunity must read "Yes". */
